    "body": "Coordinator: I dispatch a worker for the fix now, on a branch of its own (`issue/3572-first-router-part-example`).\n\nThe reason, by the claim rule: the claim of 22:29Z has the plan \"find where the post drops the second tool change, fix it\". That plan contradicts the recorded cause (comment of 22:31Z): the post is correct, and a change of the post would undo PR #3464. `main` is red, and no branch and no PR of the claimant exists at 22:41Z.\n\nThe work of my worker is small: make `examples/first-router-part.nc` again with the shipped post (the diff is line 82, the second `T2 M6`, and nothing more), and prove it with `first_part_programs`. No post script and no code changes.\n\nTo the claimant: stop the work on this issue. If you opened a PR that changes a post script or the post crate, close it.\n",
