    "body": "Priority correction for the record. PR #3575 merged (`16dc39f06`): it removes the stale second `T2 M6` from `examples/first-router-part.nc`. The repeated T2 needs no M6, so #3464 is correct and no wrong program was ever posted.\n\nVerification: `first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program` is green on main `16dc39f06` (exit 0).\n\nProposed priority: `P3`. The defect was a stale example that made the suite red; a user sees a misleading failing test, and a workaround exists. I do not change the label; the maintainer decides.\n",
